      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Two patients with immunoglobulin (Ig)A nephropathy and severe flank pain as the presenting or predominant symptom are described. Recognition of the possible association between IgA nephropathy and severe pain may have altered the approach to these patients who underwent extensive evaluation for hematuria."},
